{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28268","headline":"题安州浮云寺楼寄湖州张郎中 · 杜牧","name":"题安州浮云寺楼寄湖州张郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去夏疎雨余，同倚朱阑语。\n当时楼下水，今日到何处？\n恨如春草多，事与孤鸿去。\n楚岸柳何穷，别愁纷若絮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}